      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds like a good start, but let's get more specific. I want to make sure we aren't missing anything that could jeopardize the application. Did you run into any potential conflicts with the existing patents in the database? Specifically, I'm worried about anything related to modular cooling structures or integrated thermal management systems. Give me a quick breakdown of what you found.",
